<ul>
<li>We’ve deprecated <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/fast-mode">fast mode</a> for Claude Opus 4.8, with removal on November 30, 2026. After removal, requests to <code>claude-opus-4-8</code> with <code>speed: &quot;fast&quot;</code> will return an error. To continue using fast mode, migrate to <a href="/docs/en/models/opus-5-5/migration-guide#migrating-from-claude-opus-4-8">Claude Opus 5.5</a>. Read more in <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/fast-mode#supported-models">Fast mode model availability</a>.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="october-29-2026" class="group">October 29, 2026<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to October 29, 2026" id="_R_2g5ncqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<ul>
<li>We’ve launched the <a href="/docs/en/manage-claude/usage-cost-analytics-api">Usage and Cost Analytics API</a> in beta with the <code>analytics-usage-cost-2026-08-24</code> beta header. Its <code>/v1/organizations/analytics/usage</code> and <code>/v1/organizations/analytics/cost</code> endpoints report token usage and cost for Claude Console and Claude Enterprise organizations. You can filter and group results by dimensions such as model, workspace, API key, and the user or service account behind each request.</li>
<li>The <a href="/docs/en/manage-claude/usage-cost-api">Usage and Cost API</a> is now a legacy API, and so are the <code>usage_report</code>, <code>cost_report</code>, <code>user_usage_report</code>, and <code>user_cost_report</code> endpoints of the <a href="/docs/en/manage-claude/analytics-api">Claude Enterprise Analytics API</a>. All of them remain supported. To move an existing integration, see <a href="/docs/en/manage-claude/usage-cost-analytics-api#migrate-from-usage-cost-api">Migrate from the Usage and Cost API</a> or <a href="/docs/en/manage-claude/usage-cost-analytics-api#migrate-from-enterprise-analytics-reports">Migrate from the Claude Enterprise usage and cost reports</a>.</li>
</ul>
