<ul>
<li>You can now set an expiration when you create an API key or an Admin API key in the <a href="https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude Console</a>. Choose a preset, a custom duration, or <strong>Never</strong>. For keys with a lifetime of at least 7 days, Anthropic emails the creator before expiration. Existing keys are unaffected. The Admin API reports each key’s expiration in the <a id="_R_16hg7cqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" aria-describedby="_R_n6hg7cqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH1_" href="/docs/en/api/beta/organization/api_keys/list"><code>expires_at</code></a><span id="_R_n6hg7cqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH1_" data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Preview with links to the API reference available — press Tab until focus enters the card, Escape to return.</span> field. See <a href="/docs/en/manage-claude/authentication#key-expiration">Key expiration in Authentication</a>.</li>
</ul>
