<ul>
<li>The <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/web-search-tool">web search tool</a> now returns richer SEC filing data, making it easier to ground financial research agents, earnings analysis, and due-diligence workflows in primary sources with citations.</li>
</ul>
