<ul>
<li>We’ve launched <strong>Claude Platform on AWS</strong>, bringing the Claude API to Anthropic-managed infrastructure accessible through AWS, with AWS billing and IAM authentication. Access the full Messages API, Files API, Message Batches API, Claude Managed Agents, Agent Skills, code execution, and tool use through native AWS endpoints. Learn more in <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-platform-on-aws">Claude Platform on AWS</a>.</li>
</ul>
