<ul>
<li>We’ve released the <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/agent-skills/claude-api-skill">Claude API skill</a>, an open-source <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/agent-skills/overview">Agent Skill</a> that gives Claude up-to-date reference material for building on the Messages API and Claude Managed Agents across eight languages. The skill is bundled with Claude Code and available in the <a href="https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/claude-api" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Anthropic skills repository</a>.</li>
</ul>
