<ul>
<li>We’ve launched a <strong>new documentation platform</strong> at <a href="https://platform.claude.com/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">platform.claude.com/docs</a>. Our documentation now lives side by side with the Claude Console, providing a unified developer experience. The previous docs site at docs.claude.com will redirect to the new location.</li>
</ul>
