<ul>
<li>We’ve launched <strong>Claude in Microsoft Foundry</strong>, bringing Claude models to Azure customers with Azure billing and OAuth authentication. Access the full Messages API including extended thinking, prompt caching (5-minute and 1-hour), PDF support, Files API, Agent Skills, and tool use. Learn more in <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-microsoft-foundry">Claude in Microsoft Foundry</a>.</li>
</ul>
