<ul>
<li>We’ve launched v2 of the <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/code-execution-tool">Code Execution Tool</a> in beta, replacing the original Python-only tool with Bash command execution and direct file manipulation capabilities, including writing code in other languages.</li>
</ul>
