<ul>
<li>We’ve released the <a href="/docs/en/manage-claude/usage-cost-api">Usage &amp; Cost API</a>, allowing administrators to programmatically monitor their organization’s usage and cost data.</li>
<li>We’ve added a new endpoint to the Admin API for retrieving organization information. For details, see the <a id="_R_l3jfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" aria-describedby="_R_bl3jfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH1_" href="/docs/en/api/beta/organization/retrieve">Organization Info Admin API reference</a><span id="_R_bl3jfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH1_" data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">Preview with links to the API reference available — press Tab until focus enters the card, Escape to return.</span>.</li>
</ul>
