<ul>
<li>We announced the deprecation of the Claude Sonnet 3.5 models (<code>claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620</code> and <code>claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022</code>). These models will be retired on October 28, 2025. We recommend migrating to Claude Sonnet 4.5 (<code>claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929</code>) for improved performance and capabilities. Read more in <a href="/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations">Model deprecations</a>.</li>
<li>The 1-hour cache duration for prompt caching no longer requires a beta header. Learn more in <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-caching#1-hour-cache-duration">1-hour cache duration</a>.</li>
</ul>
