<ul>
<li>Some customers might encounter <a href="/docs/en/api/errors">429 (<code>rate_limit_error</code>) errors</a> following a sharp increase in API usage because of acceleration limits on the API. Previously, 529 (<code>overloaded_error</code>) errors would occur in similar scenarios.</li>
</ul>
