<ul>
<li>Search result content blocks are out of beta on the Claude API and Vertex AI. This feature enables natural citations for RAG applications with proper source attribution. The beta header <code>search-results-2025-06-09</code> is no longer required. Learn more in <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/search-results">Search results</a>.</li>
</ul>
