<ul>
<li>In the Console, users with the Developer role can now access the <a href="https://console.anthropic.com/settings/cost" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cost</a> page. Previously, the Developer role allowed access to the <a href="https://console.anthropic.com/settings/usage" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Usage</a> page, but not the Cost page.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="june-11-2025" class="group">June 11, 2025<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to June 11, 2025" id="_R_2jvvcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<ul>
<li>We’ve launched <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/fine-grained-tool-streaming">fine-grained tool streaming</a> in beta, a feature that enables Claude to stream tool use parameters without buffering / JSON validation. To enable fine-grained tool streaming, use the <a href="/docs/en/api/beta-headers">beta header</a> <code>fine-grained-tool-streaming-2025-05-14</code>.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="may-22-2025" class="group">May 22, 2025<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to May 22, 2025" id="_R_2k0vcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<ul>
<li>We’ve launched <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude Opus 4 and Claude Sonnet 4</a>, our latest models with extended thinking capabilities. Learn more in <a href="/docs/en/models/overview">Models overview</a>.</li>
<li>The default behavior of <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/extended-thinking">extended thinking</a> in Claude 4 models returns a summary of Claude’s full thinking process, with the full thinking encrypted and returned in the <code>signature</code> field of <code>thinking</code> block output.</li>
<li>We’ve launched <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/thinking#interleaved-thinking">interleaved thinking</a> in beta, a feature that enables Claude to think in between tool calls. To enable interleaved thinking, use the <a href="/docs/en/api/beta-headers">beta header</a> <code>interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14</code>.</li>
<li>We’ve launched the <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/files">Files API</a> in beta, enabling you to upload files and reference them in the Messages API and code execution tool.</li>
<li>We’ve launched the <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/code-execution-tool">Code execution tool</a> in beta, a tool that enables Claude to execute Python code in a secure, sandboxed environment.</li>
<li>We’ve launched the <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/mcp-connector">MCP connector</a> in beta, a feature that allows you to connect to remote MCP servers directly from the Messages API.</li>
<li>To increase answer quality and decrease tool errors, we’ve changed the default value for the <code>top_p</code> <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Top-p_sampling" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">nucleus sampling</a> parameter in the Messages API from 0.999 to 0.99 for all models. To revert this change, set <code>top_p</code> to 0.999.
Additionally, when extended thinking is enabled, you can now set <code>top_p</code> to values between 0.95 and 1.</li>
<li>Our <a href="https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-go" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Go SDK</a> has moved from beta to its first stable release.</li>
<li>We’ve added minute and hour level granularity to the <a href="https://console.anthropic.com/settings/usage" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Usage</a> page of Console alongside 429 error rates on the Usage page.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="may-21-2025" class="group">May 21, 2025<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to May 21, 2025" id="_R_2k1vcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Our <a href="https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-ruby" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ruby SDK</a> has moved from beta to its first stable release.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="may-7-2025" class="group">May 7, 2025<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to May 7, 2025" id="_R_2k2vcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover gro