<ul>
<li>We’ve updated <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-caching">prompt caching</a> to be easier to use. Now, when you set a cache breakpoint, we’ll automatically read from your longest previously cached prefix.</li>
<li>You can now prefill Claude’s response when using tools.</li>
</ul>
