<ul>
<li>We’ve updated our rate limits for the Messages API. We’ve replaced the tokens per minute rate limit with new input and output tokens per minute rate limits. Read more in <a href="/docs/en/api/rate-limits">Rate limits</a>.</li>
<li>We’ve added support for <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/overview">tool use</a> in the <a href="https://console.anthropic.com/workbench" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Console Workbench</a>.</li>
</ul>
