<ul>
<li>We’ve added Workspaces to the <a href="https://console.anthropic.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developer Console</a>. Workspaces allow you to set custom spend or rate limits, group API keys, track usage by project, and control access with user roles. Read more in our <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/workspaces" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Workspaces blog post</a>.</li>
</ul>
