ast request and is deleted no more than 1 hour after its last use. Message threads are available on the Claude API, \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"5\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-platform-on-aws\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Claude Platform on AWS\"]}],\", Claude Models on Google Cloud (Anthropic managed), and \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"7\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-microsoft-foundry\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Claude in Microsoft Foundry\"]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\na0:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"17\",{\"id\":\"october-30-2026\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"October 30, 2026\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L98\",null,{\"id\":\"october-30-2026\",\"name\":\"October 30, 2026\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\na1:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"19\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"We’ve deprecated \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/fast-mode\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"fast mode\"]}],\" for Claude Opus 4.8, with removal on November 30, 2026. After removal, requests to \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"claude-opus-4-8\"]}],\" with \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"speed: \\\"fast\\\"\"]}],\" will return an error. To continue using fast mode, migrate to \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"7\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/models/opus-5-5/migration-guide#migrating-from-claude-opus-4-8\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Claude Opus 5.5\"]}],\". Read more in \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"9\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/fast-mode#supported-models\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Fast mode model availability\"]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\na2:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"21\",{\"id\":\"october-29-2026\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"October 29, 2026\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\