"href\":\"/docs/en/about-claude/pricing#cloud-platform-pricing\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"global endpoint pricing\"]}],\" for Amazon Bedrock and Vertex AI. The Claude API (1P) pricing is unaffected.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"We’ve introduced a new stop reason \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"model_context_window_exceeded\"]}],\" that allows you to request the maximum possible tokens without calculating input size. Learn more in \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/handling-stop-reasons\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Handling stop reasons\"]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"We’ve launched the memory tool in beta, enabling Claude to store and consult information across conversations. Learn more in \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/memory-tool\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Memory tool\"]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"9\",{\"children\":[\"We’ve launched context editing in beta, providing strategies to automatically manage conversation context. The initial release supports clearing older tool results and calls when approaching token limits. Learn more in \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/context-editing\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Context editing\"]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n168:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"418\",{\"id\":\"september-17-2025\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"September 17, 2025\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L98\",null,{\"id\":\"september-17-2025\",\"name\":\"September 17, 2025\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\n169:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"420\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"We’ve launched tool helpers in beta for the Python and TypeScript SDKs, simplifying tool creation and execution with type-safe input validation and a tool runner for automated tool handling in conversations. For details, see the documentation for the \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/blob/main/tools.md\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Python SDK tool helpers\"]}],\" and the \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-typescript/blob/main/helpers.md#tool-helpers\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"TypeScript SDK tool helpers\"]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n16a:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"422\",{\"id\":\"september-16-2025\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"September 16, 2025\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L98\",null,{\"id\":\"september-16-2025\",\"name\":\"September 16, 2025\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\n16b:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"424\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"We’ve unified our developer offerings under the Claude brand. You should see updated naming and URLs across our platform and documentation, but \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"our developer interfaces will remain the same\"]}],\". Here are some notable changes:\",\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"4\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"Claude Console (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://console.anthropic.com\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"console.anthropic.com\"]}],\") → Claude Console (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"https://platform.claude.com\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"platform.claude.com\"]}],\"). The console will be available at both URLs until January 12, 2026. After that date, \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"5\",{\"href\":\"https://console.anthropic.com\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"console.anthropic.com\"]}],\" will automatically redirect to \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"7\",{\"href\":\"https://platform.claude.com\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"platform.claude.com\"]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"Anthropic Docs (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://docs.anthropic.com\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"docs.anthropic.com\"]}],\") → Claude Docs (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"https://docs.claude.com\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"docs.claude.com\"]}],\")\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"Anthropic Help Center (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://support.anthropic.com\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"support.anthropic.com\"]}],\") → Claude Help Center (\",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"https://support.claude.com\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"support.claude.com\"]}],\")\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"API endpoints, headers, environment variables, and SDKs remain the same. Your existing integrations will continue working without any changes.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n16c:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"426\",{\"id\":\"september-10-2025\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"September 10, 2025\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L98\",null,{\"id\":\"september-10-2025\",\"name\":\"September 10, 2025\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\n16d:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"428\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"We’ve launched the web fetch tool in beta, allowing Claude to retrieve full content from specified web pages and PDF documents. Learn more in \",[\"$\",\"$L97\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/web-fetch-tool\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Web fetch tool\"]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[